  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Genda Bizness project is to develop and test a replicable, holistic and effective approach to reduce teenage pregnancy and support vulnerable youth in urban Sierra Leone.  The project employs an integrated and multi-sector approach to address the root causes and contributing factors to teenage pregnancy in 4 urban communities of Sierra Leone, in partnership with 4 national civil society organisations.</narrative>
